==============================================================================
PART A -- tau(m) closed form, fresh sympy.summation
==============================================================================
tau(m) = k**2*m/n**2 - k*m**2/n**2 - k*m/n**2 + m**3/(3*n**2) + m**2/(2*n**2) + m/(6*n**2)
degree in m: 3
brute-force tau(m) check: 40 random (k,n,m) triples, 0 mismatches

==============================================================================
PART B -- x(D) := delta(D) + tau(gamma*k+D)/2, exact cubic in D
==============================================================================
degree in D: 3
c0 (route 1, direct Poly extraction) = gamma*k*(2*gamma**2*k**2 - 6*gamma*k**2 + 3*gamma*k + 6*k**2 - 6*k + 1)/(12*n**2)
c1 (route 1) = (gamma**2*k**2/2 - gamma*k**2 - gamma*k*n + gamma*k/2 + k**2/2 + k*n - k/2 - n/2 + 1/12)/n**2
c2 (route 1) = (2*gamma*k - 2*k - 2*n + 1)/(4*n**2)
c3 (route 1) = 1/(6*n**2)

------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Route 2: derivative-based hand assembly (tau, tau', tau'' at m=gamma*k)
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
c0 (route 2, derivative-based) = gamma*k*(2*gamma**2*k**2 - 6*gamma*k**2 + 3*gamma*k + 6*k**2 - 6*k + 1)/(12*n**2)
c1 (route 2) = (gamma**2*k**2/2 - gamma*k**2 + gamma*k/2 + k**2/2 - k/2 - n*(2*k*(gamma - 1) + 1)/2 + 1/12)/n**2
c2 (route 2) = (2*gamma*k - 2*k - 2*n + 1)/(4*n**2)
c3 (route 2) = 1/(6*n**2)

------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Cross-check route 1 vs route 2 (must be exactly zero difference)
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
diff c0: 0
diff c1: 0
